    "body": "Ah, thanks! So the patch is [here](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/6a2fbb9803ba82a9bcb1dcb64e96556b9e55fae7) and basically involves fixing up the focus if we fired the blur event and that changed (or removed) our target so that we don't need to actually focus it anymore.",
